D103-D106 helper routines ffde_* (QDYNAM dump writers; units 1140 in, 1141 checkpoint stream, 1142 q0, 1143 ain/out, 1144 fin, 1149 geometry; ffd_qdyn_* files). Generated by diff -u against the PRISTINE ATM_DRV.f (2026-10-05); inserted after 'end subroutine new_io_atmvars' (unchanged code); applies to the pristine file or after other ATM_DRV_*.patch files. Uses existing modules only (model_com, resolution, atm_com, somtq_com, geom, quscom, diag_com, constant). Env FFD_START/FFD_NSTEP, optional FFD_QDYN_STRESS=<factor> and FFD_QDYN_COMP=<subset of uvw>.

